# LF everywhere. Biome and Prettier check for LF, hook scripts run under Node
# from a bash command line, and vendored skills stay byte-diffable against
# upstream, so a CRLF checkout on Windows would break all three.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.woff2 binary
graphify-out/** linguist-generated
bun.lock linguist-generated
